# Node.js

Node.js is managed by Volta. Run `./install.sh` in this directory to install
Volta without modifying shell startup files, then install the current Node.js
LTS release. `VOLTA_HOME` and `PATH` are managed by the repository's `.zshenv`.

Run `./update.sh` in this directory to refresh Volta and select the latest LTS
release as the default Node.js version.
